            "id": "ann_1",
            "type": "note",
            "text": "Compute Shader TOP \u2014 Gaussian Blur\n\nReads an input texture (gn_tex0) via sampler2D and applies\na 2D Gaussian blur kernel. The \u0027radius\u0027 push constant\nbecomes an inspector parameter (default 4.0).\n\nFor separable two-pass blur (faster at large radii),\nsee the BlurTOP operator instead.",
